<decision #track.establish-eidolon-workflow-authoring-workspace.component-write-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6Q>
  哪个层拥有 workflow 物理写入？
  </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6Q>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6R>
    WorkflowComponent authoring workspace。
    </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6R>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6S>
    WorkflowComponent 绑定的 authoring workspace 是唯一写入 authority；CLI 和对话 tool 只投影 command。
    </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6S>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6T>
    防止 surface 绕过 canonical validation 和 containment policy。
    </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6T>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.establish-eidolon-workflow-authoring-workspace.runtime-root-binding apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6V>
  TUI 与 CLI 如何获得相同的 workspace？
  </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6V>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6W>
    通过 runtime/workDir 注入 workflow root。
    </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6W>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6X>
    二者通过同一 component factory 构造同一种 store/workspace；同一 VM 的 model tools 复用同一 component binding。
    </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6X>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6Y>
    让资源事实持久化于共享 workspace，而不是某个 surface 的临时内存。
    </?01M05F1PQ02BBRJJYG77AHXF6Y>
  )>
)>
